$\mathrm{B}_{2}$ and $\mathrm{O}_{2}$ are paramagnetic due to presence of unpaired electron. MO electronic configuration of $\mathrm{B}_{2}$ is:

$$

\sigma 1 s^{2} \sigma^{*} 1 s^{2} \sigma 2 s^{2} \sigma^{*} 2 s^{2} \pi 2 p_{x}^{1}=\pi 2 p_{y}^{1}

$$

MO electorn i.e. configuration of $\mathrm{O}_{2}$ is:

$$

\begin{array}{l}

\sigma 1 s^{2} \sigma^{*} 1 s^{2} \sigma 2 s^{2} \sigma^{*} 2 s^{2} \sigma 2 p_{z}^{2} \pi 2 p_{x}^{2} \\

=\pi 2 p_{y}^{2} \pi * 2 p_{x}^{1}=\pi * 2 p_{y}^{1}

\end{array}

$$
